<p>You must request libGDX to use GL20 explicitly. Example for Lwjgl Backend:</p>

<pre><code>LwjglApplicationConfiguration config = new LwjglApplicationConfiguration();
config.title = "Game";
config.width = 800;
config.height = 480;
config.useGL20 = true; //this is important
new LwjglApplication(new YourGame(), config);
</code></pre>

